=== layout: two-panels

# Name the hard step

@left

![Cover DNA and crop branding](assets/business_plan_samples/nifty_genes_logo.png)

@right

## nif genes and nitrogenase

- Where must the enzyme function?
- What evidence supports activity in the intended crop?
- Which result would justify the next step?

@notes

The original Nifty Genes example names nif genes and nitrogenase. That specificity gives the reader something to investigate.
Preserve that strength while testing the jump from adding genes to eliminating fertilizer use.
Source screenshot: 2021-Nifty_Genes_Executive_Summary.pdf, PDF page 1; asset nifty_genes_logo.png.
