=== layout: two-panels

# Where does this paragraph make a leap?

@left

## Nifty Genes: original wording

"The crop now has the genes necessary to produce nitrogenases and will be able to fix nitrogen from the atmosphere where it is abundantly available and therefore eliminate the need for synthetic nitrogen obtained through fertilizer."

@right

![Cover DNA and crop branding](assets/business_plan_samples/nifty_genes_logo.png)

Having the genes -> a working crop?

*What evidence belongs between those steps?*

@notes

Quotation transcribed visually from 2021-Nifty_Genes_Executive_Summary.pdf, PDF page 2, third paragraph.
The original wording remains editable Djot text. Ask students to identify the missing evidence; do not endorse the proposed result.
Source screenshot: 2021-Nifty_Genes_Executive_Summary.pdf, PDF page 1; asset nifty_genes_logo.png.
